 and literary culture. Also included are Austen's letters, the first reviews and some later reactions, and illustrations characterizing the world of the novel.", "covers": [12648559], "source_records": ["marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/ab.bib.09.20150123.full.mrc:512952156:1229", "marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_006.bib.mrc:114863733:4042"], "ocaid": "janeaustenspride0000aust_b4x4", "isbn_10": ["0321105079"], "isbn_13": ["9780321105073"], "lccn": ["2002030162"], "oclc_numbers": ["50477169"], "lc_classifications": ["PR4034 .P7 2003"], "latest_revision": 6, "revision": 6, "created": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2022-02-26T17:28:24.096409"}, "last_modified": {"type": "/type/datetime", "value": "2026-03-07T17:03:39.186123"}}